  "description": "Summer/Winter Operating Area: Bahamas, USA - Florida East Coast\n\nDREAM ON (former ANDIAMO, THE PROGRAM, HOOTER PATROL IV) is a 29.57m / 97ft Luxury Motor Yacht built in 2006 by Hargrave with interior design by Yacht Interiors by Shelley and later underwent a refit in 2016. Sleeping 10 guests in 5 cabins and with a crew of 4. Cruising at 13.00 kn/ph with a top speed of 19.00 kn/ph. The guest cabins comprise a primary suite with a king size bed and en-suite bathroom facilities located amidship, a VIP suite with a queen size bed and a pullman bed and en-suite bathroom facilities, a cabin with a queen size bed and a pullman bed and en-suite bathroom facilities, a cabin with a queen size bed and en-suite bathroom facilities and a cabin with 2 single beds and en-suite bathroom facilities.",
